2 CONT final rites for Mrs. Sam Larson, 70, of Badger, were held at Badger Lutheran Churchat 2 p.m. tuesday, burial at Blossom Hill. Mrs. O. N. Siverson sang during the service. There also was a vocal duet by Harry and Harris Peterson. M
2 CONC rs. Larson died suddently last Friday evening following a heart attack.
