2 CONT Clara Alice Thompson1 F, #7521, b. 30 September 1911, d. August 1938
2 CONT      Clara Alice Thompson was born on 30 September 1911.1 She married Donald Harry Extrom, son of Harry Arthur Extrom and Frances Goodyear Fincham, on 30 March 1935.1 Clara Alice Thompson died in August 1938 at Hinsdale, DuPage Co
2 CONC unty, Illinois, at age 26.1 She was buried at Parkholm Cemetery, LaGrange, Cook County, Illinois.1 Family Donald Harry Extrom b. 13 Oct 1911, d. 28 Oct 1966 Citations [S65] Newpaper clipping, Evans scrapbook , p 21. Taken from LeR
