1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dorothy Thompson (1931-1983) was an accountant for New Jersey Bell Telephone.
2 CONT
2 CONT Obituary:
2 CONT Dorothy Leale, 52, of Ridgefield died yesterday. She was an accountant for New Jersey Bell Telephone for 20 years. Surviving is a brother, Edward Thompson of Ridgefield. Her husband, Steven, died in 1974. Services will be tomorrow
2 CONC  at 8 p.m. at the Blackley Funeral Home, Ridgefield, with burial in Fairview Cemetery. Visiting hours are to be arranged. 
