1 NAME Sven Jørgensen /Tjørhom/ II
2 GIVN Sven Jørgensen
2 NSFX II
2 _MARNM Tjørhom
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 17 FEB 1928
2 ADDR
3 CITY Tjørhom
